'''The Basement''' is one of the environments in [[Chapter 1]]. Unlocked at the beginning of the game, it is considered the easiest of the environments in the game. The theme of the Basement is flies and poop.

The Basement's harder unlockable variants are the {{s|Cellar}} and the {{s|Burning Basement}}.

{{dlc+|r}} After {{a|A Secret Exit}} is unlocked, a locked door similar to the one leading to a {{R|Treasure Room}} will appear in this floor's {{R|Boss Room}} upon defeating the boss, which leads to {{s|Downpour}} / {{s|Dross}}. Like a {{R|Treasure Room}}, this door requires a key to be unlocked. Unlike {{R|Angel Room}}s and {{R|Devil Room}}s, this door never disappears.{{dlc-}}

