== Trivia ==
* The Basement's backdrop consists of an unfinished wooden basement in a relatively good condition, with a mostly clean floor without visible planks, unlike the {{s|Cellar}} and the {{s|Burning Basement}}.

== Unlockable [[Achievement]]s ==
{{achievement text | Monstro's Tooth, Something From The Future, The Cellar, Sprinkler, Basement Boy }}

== Music ==
* The [[music]] for the Basement is titled ''Diptera Sonata''.<ref>[https://ridiculon.bandcamp.com/album/the-binding-of-isaac-rebirth-ost Binding of Isaac: Rebirth OST]</ref>
** [[wikipedia:Diptera|Diptera]] is the [[wikipedia:Order (biology)|order]] of true flies. Thus, ''Diptera Sonata'' literally means "Fly Sonata".

